WEBVTT

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:12.388
No retreat!

00:00:18.728 --> 00:00:20.771
The situation is dire.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.524
Why don't you withdraw by yourself?

00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:25.902
Please don't worry about me.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:29.572
We still have yet to see anything.

00:00:30.406 --> 00:00:32.533
Is that so?

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:34.327
Yes?

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:35.953
Nothing...

00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:40.917
I just felt something odd,
coming from inside of it.

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:43.085
From inside?

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:45.755
Or perhaps I should
say from the other side?

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:46.964
It can't be...

00:00:47.173 --> 00:00:50.593
Has the Creator God,
the Snake of the Festival, returned?

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.637
It's certainly possible.

00:01:49.777 --> 00:01:50.736
Yeah...

00:01:50.945 --> 00:01:53.406
It feels like a waste to
destroy these masterpieces.

00:01:53.614 --> 00:01:57.576
An ephemeral dream, of the
living world, dreamed by a god.

00:01:57.785 --> 00:02:00.621
No one will blame us
when the dream is destroyed.

00:02:19.724 --> 00:02:21.892
Yeah, that was close.

00:02:22.101 --> 00:02:25.021
Hmm, a single one would be fatal.

00:02:25.229 --> 00:02:27.356
We should be very careful.

00:02:27.565 --> 00:02:30.735
Yeah, but...

00:02:32.653 --> 00:02:33.487
Hmm.

00:02:33.696 --> 00:02:35.698
We have a plan.

00:02:39.327 --> 00:02:40.328
Ceremonial Equipment.

00:02:40.536 --> 00:02:42.955
Deploy Qadesh's Blood Seal.

00:02:48.878 --> 00:02:50.296
Activate.

00:02:51.172 --> 00:02:54.675
Constructing Unrestricted
System, Qadesh's Blood Pulse.

00:02:56.635 --> 00:02:58.095
Deploying-

00:03:00.056 --> 00:03:03.642
Synchronizing with Unrestricted
System, Qadesh's Blood Pulse.

00:03:10.733 --> 00:03:12.360
What?

00:03:18.449 --> 00:03:20.326
Yeah, but...

00:03:20.534 --> 00:03:22.828
Hmm... Likely.

00:03:24.205 --> 00:03:25.373
As you fought,

00:03:25.581 --> 00:03:28.876
you split all these parts from me.

00:03:29.085 --> 00:03:31.921
But you are no threat to me.

00:03:37.134 --> 00:03:37.968
Yeah.

00:03:38.177 --> 00:03:40.054
He's started to tear apart the materials

00:03:40.262 --> 00:03:42.515
we worked so hard to collect.

00:03:42.723 --> 00:03:45.309
Hmm, battle means destruction.

00:03:45.518 --> 00:03:49.105
It's the way of the world,
and we must accept it.

00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:54.902
You may command great power,
but it changes nothing.

00:03:55.111 --> 00:03:56.737
You simply follow the path of your life,

00:03:56.946 --> 00:03:59.949
carrying out your assigned tasks,
and killing as you are told.

00:04:01.867 --> 00:04:04.495
I will be able to defeat them,

00:04:04.703 --> 00:04:06.997
but not through anything I've done.

00:04:07.206 --> 00:04:09.875
Simply because of the power I wield.

00:04:35.401 --> 00:04:36.026
This is bad.

00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:37.653
Destroy.

00:04:58.549 --> 00:05:00.801
Khamsin Nbh'w, look ahead!

00:05:10.769 --> 00:05:12.188
I don't understand.

00:05:12.396 --> 00:05:16.692
What meaning is there in obsessing
over something this small?

00:05:20.821 --> 00:05:23.782
"From Rift to Rift"

00:06:02.154 --> 00:06:03.113
Shana“.

00:06:03.322 --> 00:06:05.241
You can still return to me,

00:06:05.449 --> 00:06:07.993
and walk beside me,
toward the Grand Order.

00:06:08.202 --> 00:06:11.121
Yuji, you can stop
working with Ball Masque,

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.457
and help me.

00:06:13.666 --> 00:06:16.126
I can't do that!

00:06:22.341 --> 00:06:24.426
No, I can't.

00:06:24.635 --> 00:06:26.053
No matter what.

00:06:26.262 --> 00:06:31.058
I've told Yuji Sakai everything,
concealing nothing.

00:06:32.685 --> 00:06:35.437
He took my hand,

00:06:35.646 --> 00:06:40.025
knowing what will happen
once the Grand Order is achieved.

00:06:40.234 --> 00:06:42.236
He wishes to liberate

00:06:42.444 --> 00:06:45.322
the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer
from her destiny of battle.

00:06:45.531 --> 00:06:48.409
He wishes to protect his friends and family.

00:06:48.617 --> 00:06:51.203
Thus was his decision made.

00:06:51.412 --> 00:06:54.415
To stand with the Ball Masque.

00:07:06.135 --> 00:07:07.553
Thoughtless words

00:07:07.761 --> 00:07:10.848
will not sway his resolve.

00:07:11.056 --> 00:07:13.934
Bel-Peol, is my return
having its expected effect?

00:07:14.143 --> 00:07:17.104
Professor, you can synchronize
with the Conloquium, yes?

00:07:17.313 --> 00:07:20.149
Of course I can!

00:07:20.357 --> 00:07:23.902
We can use it to detect
changes in the world beyond,

00:07:24.111 --> 00:07:26.405
from our vantage point here,
on the Path of Pilgrimage!

00:07:26.614 --> 00:07:30.284
The miracle of science
makes this possible,

00:07:30.492 --> 00:07:37.374
the Excellent 252546
Logical Pilgrim's Box!

00:07:37.583 --> 00:07:40.461
Of course, ninety percent
goes to observation devices,

00:07:40.669 --> 00:07:41.795
developed for other purposes.

00:07:42.004 --> 00:07:43.547
Ow!

00:07:43.756 --> 00:07:45.799
Now, then!

00:07:46.008 --> 00:07:50.679
Press the button, and the
helmet goes down on the head!

00:07:50.888 --> 00:07:53.098
It's coming! It's coming!

00:07:53.307 --> 00:07:55.768
It's coming!

00:07:55.976 --> 00:07:57.102
It's excellent!

00:07:57.311 --> 00:08:00.397
Massive quakes that are not
quakes, engulfing everything!

00:08:00.606 --> 00:08:04.443
The destruction of the gigantic structures,
in the rift between two worlds,

00:08:04.652 --> 00:08:07.279
have caused a contraction,

00:08:07.488 --> 00:08:10.366
which now creates a natural disaster

00:08:10.574 --> 00:08:14.078
unlike any seen in history!

00:08:14.286 --> 00:08:17.998
Here and now, I name thee:

00:08:18.207 --> 00:08:20.376
The Mistquake!

00:08:37.601 --> 00:08:38.686
This is...

00:08:38.894 --> 00:08:41.438
Is it really the Creator God?

00:08:53.575 --> 00:08:55.411
The Mistquake...

00:08:55.619 --> 00:08:56.328
Yes...

00:08:56.537 --> 00:08:59.665
A vibration that shakes the world itself,

00:08:59.873 --> 00:09:02.459
which only those who control
the Power of Existence can feel.

00:09:02.668 --> 00:09:06.004
Just a small fragment
of my Grand Order.

00:09:42.916 --> 00:09:44.877
What's going on here?

00:09:45.085 --> 00:09:45.836
Dunno.

00:09:46.044 --> 00:09:50.174
Regardless, this confusion isn't
a good sign for us, the attackers.

00:09:50.382 --> 00:09:52.384
Yeah, I guess it's time to go.

00:09:52.593 --> 00:09:54.219
Where's Chiara?

00:09:58.182 --> 00:09:59.683
What's happening?

00:09:59.892 --> 00:10:02.144
It's not an earthquake...

00:10:02.352 --> 00:10:04.396
Think it's an enemy Unrestricted Method?

00:10:04.605 --> 00:10:06.023
No, it's not.

00:10:06.231 --> 00:10:08.317
They' re uneasy, too.

00:10:11.653 --> 00:10:13.280
Mammon!

00:10:20.204 --> 00:10:22.706
This is the natural disaster

00:10:22.915 --> 00:10:27.753
that the Strategist spoke of.

00:10:29.963 --> 00:10:34.468
This quake is the doing of our master,
the Snake of the Festival!

00:10:34.676 --> 00:10:37.137
We will charge the enemy base!

00:10:37.346 --> 00:10:39.348
All forces, forward!

00:11:13.382 --> 00:11:14.091
Yeah.

00:11:14.299 --> 00:11:18.178
Either way,
we must fight until we die.

00:11:18.387 --> 00:11:20.347
With no means of fighting back,

00:11:20.556 --> 00:11:23.183
we must wait for the
situation to change, indeed.

00:11:24.017 --> 00:11:27.729
And until then, we've
gotta keep walking the tightrope.

00:11:31.817 --> 00:11:36.071
What meaning does
continuing this battle hold?

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.365
Why do you Struggle?

00:11:38.574 --> 00:11:40.200
All of you.

00:11:50.627 --> 00:11:53.630
You will defeat me
and force me to obey?

00:11:57.593 --> 00:11:59.344
<i>Master .</i>

00:11:59.553 --> 00:12:02.890
You think nothing of using
the God of Atonement's power

00:12:03.098 --> 00:12:05.142
as a threat?

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:07.102
You wouldn't know this,

00:12:07.311 --> 00:12:10.772
but before she made her contract to
be the Flame-Haired Burning-Eyed Slayer,

00:12:10.981 --> 00:12:13.108
she said this to me:

00:12:13.317 --> 00:12:14.568
"They say the Flame Hazes

00:12:14.776 --> 00:12:19.156
fight the Crimson Denizens, in order
to maintain balance in the world.

00:12:19.364 --> 00:12:24.369
I will watch, and then decide
for myself whether that is true.

00:12:24.578 --> 00:12:27.122
No matter how much everyone loves me,

00:12:27.331 --> 00:12:29.917
and no matter how
much I love everyone,

00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:33.837
if I don't like it, I just can't do it."

00:12:39.718 --> 00:12:42.387
Such a girl has challenged you,

00:12:42.596 --> 00:12:45.390
as she tries to walk her own path,

00:12:45.599 --> 00:12:48.268
having seen your Grand Order.

00:12:48.477 --> 00:12:51.647
How could I be unhappy with that?

00:12:51.855 --> 00:12:53.023
She...

00:12:53.231 --> 00:12:55.651
Yes, she alone has greatness

00:12:55.859 --> 00:12:57.861
worthy of being my contractor,

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:01.281
following the path others fear to tread,

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:03.367
head held high.

00:13:04.534 --> 00:13:08.121
Atonement not only protects
the world from disruption,

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.208
but becomes the world's final judgment.

00:13:11.416 --> 00:13:12.542
Therefore,

00:13:12.751 --> 00:13:15.379
I walk alongside this great one,

00:13:15.587 --> 00:13:18.340
charting the path we shall take.

00:13:19.549 --> 00:13:20.509
I see.

00:13:20.717 --> 00:13:24.137
Then we shall follow our path, as well.

00:13:24.346 --> 00:13:25.764
Upon my return,

00:13:25.973 --> 00:13:28.976
you may listen to my declaration
of the Grand Order.

00:13:48.286 --> 00:13:50.414
That is the master of the Ball Masque.

00:13:50.622 --> 00:13:53.625
The Creator God,
the Snake of the Festival.

00:14:09.141 --> 00:14:12.019
That is the Snake of the Festival?

00:14:12.227 --> 00:14:16.231
A true God... a Crimson God?

00:14:17.315 --> 00:14:17.983
Activate!

00:14:18.191 --> 00:14:20.777
Deploy Qadesh's Blood Pulse.

00:14:22.029 --> 00:14:22.821
Synchronize.

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:26.033
Release Qadesh's Blood Pulse!

00:15:08.784 --> 00:15:11.369
This time, it's over!

00:15:31.556 --> 00:15:33.475
What size...

00:15:33.683 --> 00:15:35.602
Amazing.

00:15:35.811 --> 00:15:37.437
Is this it?

00:15:39.856 --> 00:15:42.275
Looks like they kicked your butt.

00:15:42.484 --> 00:15:45.195
Sorry, but you'll have to
stay that way until my return.

00:15:45.403 --> 00:15:46.571
Don't worry about me.

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:47.906
What?

00:15:48.115 --> 00:15:49.533
For now...

00:15:49.908 --> 00:15:50.992
Destruction Blade?

00:15:51.201 --> 00:15:52.828
For now,

00:15:53.328 --> 00:15:56.957
I just want to watch it a little longer.

00:15:57.165 --> 00:15:58.875
It's huge.

00:15:59.084 --> 00:16:04.840
An overwhelming power,
far too strong to resist.

00:16:05.048 --> 00:16:07.509
Is this fear?

00:16:07.717 --> 00:16:09.803
The feeling you had toward me?

00:16:10.011 --> 00:16:14.349
The reason you left me?

00:16:14.558 --> 00:16:16.101
<i>'An.</i>

00:16:16.309 --> 00:16:19.980
lam jealous of you.

00:16:20.188 --> 00:16:24.609
What I have is too small, too faint...

00:16:25.986 --> 00:16:30.490
Is this how I made you feel?

00:16:30.699 --> 00:16:31.700
Yes...

00:16:31.908 --> 00:16:37.414
Feeling this way, you could
never have stayed with me.

00:16:37.622 --> 00:16:40.083
But now, I have learned

00:16:40.292 --> 00:16:45.422
that there is a being
greater by far than myself.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:52.762
And that, from its perspective,
both you and I are as nothing.

00:16:52.971 --> 00:16:54.639
So smile,

00:16:56.641 --> 00:17:00.270
my beautiful butterfly...

00:17:19.956 --> 00:17:23.043
The Destruction Blade,
Sabrac, has fallen.

00:17:23.251 --> 00:17:24.544
I see.

00:17:24.753 --> 00:17:26.880
We managed to survive somehow.

00:17:27.088 --> 00:17:29.299
I guess so, but...

00:17:29.507 --> 00:17:32.093
But we cannot lower our guard yet.

00:17:32.302 --> 00:17:33.595
Fight onward.

00:17:33.803 --> 00:17:35.972
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:36.181 --> 00:17:37.891
Now that we're here...

00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:41.061
Indeed, we need simply to fight.

00:17:45.357 --> 00:17:49.069
The order to attack, Bel-Peol...

00:17:49.277 --> 00:17:51.154
That which falls to rubble...

00:17:51.363 --> 00:17:53.198
That which departs...

00:17:54.866 --> 00:17:57.577
For now, I set aside my sorrow.

00:17:57.786 --> 00:18:02.165
To follow my path...

00:18:08.546 --> 00:18:10.173
Begone!

00:18:13.969 --> 00:18:14.469
Shana!

00:18:14.678 --> 00:18:16.096
Yuji!

00:18:20.809 --> 00:18:25.397
It appears we haven't a
moment to spare, Takemikazuchi.

00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:28.775
I do not disagree,
Sophie Sawallisch-kun.

00:18:28.984 --> 00:18:29.985
You can't...

00:18:30.193 --> 00:18:31.945
Y-You're really going to do it?

00:18:32.153 --> 00:18:32.862
Yes.

00:18:33.071 --> 00:18:36.574
I will now attempt
to destroy the Divine Gate.

00:18:36.783 --> 00:18:38.201
Is it possible?

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.036
We must try!

00:18:40.245 --> 00:18:42.622
With the Snake of the Festival reviving,

00:18:42.831 --> 00:18:46.209
the odds that the four who
entered the gate remain safe...

00:18:46.418 --> 00:18:48.044
...are minimal.

00:18:48.253 --> 00:18:52.257
Grant to us, who sin and die,

00:18:52.465 --> 00:18:55.468
turning to nothing and unknown to all,

00:18:55.677 --> 00:18:58.888
a victory, at the least.

00:18:59.097 --> 00:19:00.849
Amen, hallelujah.

00:19:01.057 --> 00:19:02.475
<i>'An.</i>

00:19:11.568 --> 00:19:18.575
Daaaraassshaa!

00:20:22.138 --> 00:20:24.641
I will defeat you, Yuji.

00:20:24.849 --> 00:20:27.352
If the Creator God stands against me,

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.437
I'll defeat him, too.

00:20:29.646 --> 00:20:34.234
And then, I will
search for a path with you.

00:20:34.442 --> 00:20:35.360
Shana“.

00:20:35.568 --> 00:20:37.987
After you hear the
declaration of my Grand Order,

00:20:38.196 --> 00:20:42.075
if you still think it possible,
challenge me again.

00:20:42.283 --> 00:20:43.910
But for today...

00:20:46.121 --> 00:20:47.622
Time is up.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:50.500
Chigusa told me

00:20:50.708 --> 00:20:53.545
that a kiss on the lips is a vow.

00:20:56.005 --> 00:20:57.215
Shana?

00:20:57.215 --> 00:21:01.636
<i>I must be dreaming tonight</i>

00:21:01.803 --> 00:21:04.472
You can't do it...

00:21:04.472 --> 00:21:07.100
<i>We erase it from our memories</i>

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:07.976
I just will do it.

00:21:07.976 --> 00:21:08.935
<i>You can't escape</i>

00:21:08.935 --> 00:21:10.186
That's why it's a vow!

00:21:10.186 --> 00:21:13.982
<i>I only know this secret with you</i>

00:21:18.403 --> 00:21:23.700
<i>How can I protect you forever?</i>

00:21:23.908 --> 00:21:25.076
<i>Close your eyes</i>

00:21:25.285 --> 00:21:29.205
<i>I'll be anything for you</i>

00:21:29.414 --> 00:21:31.458
<i>I can't live this life</i>

00:21:31.666 --> 00:21:36.880
<i>Without you by my side</i>

00:21:38.965 --> 00:21:44.429
<i>"I'll believe..."</i>

00:21:54.397 --> 00:21:57.066
At last, the hour has come.

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:01.571
My return is complete!

00:22:01.571 --> 00:22:04.324
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:22:04.532 --> 00:22:07.911
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:22:08.119 --> 00:22:11.080
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:22:11.289 --> 00:22:17.045
<i>It is the reason why I continue to exist</i>

00:22:17.253 --> 00:22:18.338
<i>Inside of Kaos I say</i>

00:22:18.546 --> 00:22:21.674
<i>Where can I get the
real love and fate, right now?</i>

00:22:21.883 --> 00:22:25.094
<i>All people, everyone, forget things,</i>

00:22:25.303 --> 00:22:28.473
<i>Even their aching scars</i>

00:22:28.681 --> 00:22:31.809
<i>Each time I see the passage of time,</i>

00:22:32.018 --> 00:22:35.188
<i>These emotions fade</i>

00:22:35.396 --> 00:22:39.108
<i>But I don't want to
overlook things any longer</i>

00:22:39.317 --> 00:22:42.028
<i>Back and forth, the screaming
in my heart won't stop (time over)</i>

00:22:42.237 --> 00:22:48.576
<i>The vanishing afterimage,
that is you in and of itself</i>

00:22:48.785 --> 00:22:50.286
<i>So now that you & I</i>

00:22:50.495 --> 00:22:51.538
<i>I can't live life</i>

00:22:51.746 --> 00:22:53.498
<i>Without you by my side...</i>

00:22:53.706 --> 00:22:57.126
<i>"I'll believe..." Even in the
fatality of solitude (Yeah, yeah)</i>

00:22:57.335 --> 00:23:00.463
<i>The fragments of the burning records</i>

00:23:00.672 --> 00:23:03.883
<i>Reflect tomorrow's brightness
(Can see your light)</i>

00:23:04.092 --> 00:23:06.928
<i>If the luster that made you shine</i>

00:23:07.136 --> 00:23:10.682
<i>ls also inside of me,
(then I'm sure that we can go)</i>

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:13.810
<i>I will go and prove everything</i>

00:23:14.018 --> 00:23:22.527
<i>"I'll believe..." in a tomorrow
where we coexist, (Yeah, "I'll believe")</i>

00:23:22.527 --> 00:23:24.904
It's the sound of
the next battle starting.

00:23:27.115 --> 00:23:28.825
The Snake of the Festival returns

00:23:29.033 --> 00:23:31.869
to decree the Grand Order's final stage.

00:23:32.078 --> 00:23:36.708
The shaken Flame Hazes are
forced to retreat, but...

00:23:36.916 --> 00:23:39.127
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:39.335 --> 00:23:40.837
"Declaration of the Grand Order."
